# Note: data/*.csv, *.joblib, *.json are intentionally COMMITTED (not
# ignored) even though they're regenerated by src/*.py - total size is
# ~1MB, and committing them means the app works immediately after a clone
# without requiring a judge to rerun the full pipeline first.

